- You have to go home now!

548
00:25:15,400 --> 00:25:17,067
They're demolishing
Ginintuang Lupa!

549
00:25:17,067 --> 00:25:18,333
- Huh?!
- [ROSANNA] Go home!

550
00:25:18,333 --> 00:25:19,833
- Right now!
- Alright, alright.

551
00:25:19,833 --> 00:25:21,100
We're on our way.

552
00:25:21,100 --> 00:25:22,167
- Gabo.
- Why?

553
00:25:22,167 --> 00:25:24,267
They're demolishing
Ginintuang Lupa!

554
00:25:24,267 --> 00:25:25,267
What?!

555
00:25:26,300 --> 00:25:27,833
Let's go!

556
00:25:27,833 --> 00:25:29,367
- Come on!
- Come on, let's follow them!

557
00:25:31,333 --> 00:25:31,933
- [FOREBODING MUSIC PLAYING]
- [PEOPLE CLAMORING]

558
00:25:32,067 --> 00:25:35,033
