561
00:25:46,967 --> 00:25:53,900
[CROWD JEERING ANGRILY]

562
00:25:54,000 --> 00:25:57,233
[HEAVY FOOTSTEPS APPROACHING]

563
00:26:07,200 --> 00:26:10,567
[CROWD JEERING ANGRILY]

564
00:26:10,733 --> 00:26:11,767
Get out of here!

565
00:26:17,067 --> 00:26:17,933
Sir.

566
00:26:18,033 --> 00:26:19,367
We're in a critical situation.

567
00:26:19,833 --> 00:26:22,333
These people
won't surrender this land.

568
00:26:22,900 --> 00:26:25,333
I don't care about these scums.

569
00:26:25,500 --> 00:26:27,300
- Get out of here!
- Leave!

570
00:26:27,467 --> 00:26:28,633
Do what's necessary.

571
00:26:28,733 --> 00:26:30,467
We'll clean up this area.

572
00:26:30,733 --> 00:26:32,633
[CROWD JEERING ANGRILY]

573
00:26:32,733 --> 00:26:34,800
- [MUSIC TURNS TENSE]
- [BETCHAY] Rudy!

574
00:26:36,900 --> 00:26:37,833
Move! Move!

575
00:26:39,900 --> 00:26:41,800
You come here acting cocky!

576
00:26:41,900 --> 00:26:43,333
You really think
we won't fight back?!

577
00:26:44,233 --> 00:26:48,133
Hey! You can't make us
leave our homes!

578
00:26:48,233 --> 00:26:50,367
We're not leaving!
You're the one who should leave!

579
00:26:50,533 --> 00:26:51,900
She's right!
We're not going anywhere!

580
00:26:53,767 --> 00:26:55,833
- Try to go near our homes!
- Ma!

581
00:26:56,000 --> 00:26:57,500
There will be bloodshed!

582
00:26:57,600 --> 00:27:00,000
Hold on! I've got
the court order right here!

583
00:27:00,400 --> 00:27:01,500
According to the court,

584
00:27:01,600 --> 00:27:04,867
