and development

586
00:27:07,500 --> 00:27:08,633
of Ginintuang Lupa!

587
00:27:08,733 --> 00:27:09,733
You can't do that!

588
00:27:09,867 --> 00:27:11,833
You can't make us
leave this place

589
00:27:11,933 --> 00:27:13,067
because this is ours!

590
00:27:13,200 --> 00:27:14,300
- This is ours!
- This is ours!

591
00:27:14,400 --> 00:27:16,133
[BETCHAY]
There will be bloodshed!

592
00:27:16,267 --> 00:27:18,900
[CROWD JEERING ANGRILY]

593
00:27:19,067 --> 00:27:20,067
[TEKLA] Move!

594
00:27:23,067 --> 00:27:24,367
Get out of here! Out!

595
00:27:25,933 --> 00:27:26,867
Back off!

596
00:27:26,967 --> 00:27:32,700
[TENSE MUSIC INTENSIFIES]

597
00:27:32,800 --> 00:27:33,833
Move!

598
00:27:36,900 --> 00:27:38,500
- Pa!
- Betchay!

599
00:27:42,633 --> 00:27:44,033
They're taking our land!

600
00:27:44,200 --> 00:27:47,433
Gabo, they're making us
leave our land!

601
00:27:49,833 --> 00:27:51,533
Stand back!
We'll take care of this!

602
00:27:51,633 --> 00:27:52,800
- Let's go!
- Gabo!

603
00:27:53,400 --> 00:27:54,400
Gabo!

604
00:27:54,567 --> 00:27:59,900
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING]

605
00:28:00,067 --> 00:28:06,900
[CROWD CHANTING ANGRILY]
Get them out! Get them out!

606
00:28:09,267 --> 00:28:10,733
You can't demolish our homes!

607
00:28:12,567 --> 00:28:13,733
This is our land!

608
00:28:13,967 --> 00:28:15,100
This is where we were born!

609
00:28:16,233 --> 00:28:17,733
And this is where we'll die!

610
00:28:18,233 --> 00:28:19,567
If you insist
on this demolition,

611
00:28:19,667 --> 00:28:20,867
