612
00:28:21,833 --> 00:28:23,467
none of you
will make it out alive!

613
00:28:24,267 --> 00:28:25,233
We'll fight back!

614
00:28:25,333 --> 00:28:26,500
[CROWD] Fight back!

615
00:28:26,633 --> 00:28:28,500
- We'll fight back!
- [CROWD] Fight back!

616
00:28:28,633 --> 00:28:29,600
- We'll fight back!
- [CROWD] Fight back!

617
00:28:29,767 --> 00:28:31,733
They don't own this land!
We're wasting our time!

618
00:28:32,000 --> 00:28:33,667
Start the demolition!
[KICKS AGGRESSIVELY]

619
00:28:33,800 --> 00:28:34,667
[LOUD THUD]

620
00:28:34,800 --> 00:28:37,167
[PEOPLE CLAMORING]

621
00:28:37,300 --> 00:28:41,733
- [WHACKING]
- [GLASS BREAKS]

622
00:28:41,833 --> 00:28:43,000
