623
00:28:44,933 --> 00:28:45,900
[THUDS]

624
00:28:46,200 --> 00:28:47,167
[KICK LANDS]

625
00:28:47,767 --> 00:28:50,933
Neighbors! Let's fight back!

626
00:28:52,467 --> 00:28:55,000
Let's fight for our rights!

627
00:28:57,333 --> 00:28:58,967
We were born here in this land,

628
00:28:59,367 --> 00:29:01,333
- and we will die in this land!
- [GLASS SHATTERS]

629
00:29:05,067 --> 00:29:06,133
Keep going!

630
00:29:07,633 --> 00:29:08,633
[KICK LANDS]

631
00:29:12,467 --> 00:29:14,133
[SLINGSHOTS SNAP]

632
00:29:14,833 --> 00:29:16,300
Sir, we're in danger!
Let's leave!

633
00:29:16,800 --> 00:29:17,767
[KICK LANDS]

634
00:29:18,367 --> 00:29:19,333
[KICK LANDS]

635
00:29:22,233 --> 00:29:23,133
[LOUD THUD]

636
00:29:23,533 --> 00:29:24,533
[KICK LANDS]

637
00:29:24,833 --> 00:29:25,967
[KICK LANDS, BLOW LANDS]

638
00:29:26,067 --> 00:29:32,533
[WHACKING]

639
00:29:35,533 --> 00:29:36,533
[BLOWS LAND]

640
00:29:36,700 --> 00:29:37,667
[BODY THUDS]

641
00:29:38,533 --> 00:29:42,800
[WHACKING]

642
00:29:44,000 --> 00:29:45,167
[GLASS SHATTERS]

643
00:29:48,700 --> 00:29:51,167
[KICK LANDS, BLOWS LAND]

644
00:29:57,500 --> 00:30:01,667
[BLOWS LAND, KICK LANDS]

645
00:30:03,533 --> 00:30:04,767
Back down! Back down!

646
00:30:06,600 --> 00:30:08,767
[GUN CLICKS] Go on! Come on!

647
00:30:10,100 --> 00:30:12,433
Hurry! Get it on camera!

648
00:30:12,800 --> 00:30:14,833
We are here at Ginintuang Lupa.

649
00:30:14,933 --> 00:30:18,533
We're witnessing police
brutality in this community.

650
00:30:18,700 --> 00:30:21,000
[WATER SPLASHING]

651
00:30:21,100 --> 00:30:24,600
[BLOWS LAND]

652
00:30:26,400 --> 00:30:28,000
Why are you here?!

653
00:30:28,100 --> 00:30:29,033
Sir! Sir--

654
00:30:29,133 --> 00:30:30,367
Nosy media!

655
00:30:30,533 --> 00:30:32,267
We're just doing our jobs!

656
00:30:32,400 --> 00:30:33,933
- We're just doing our jobs!
- You'll get hurt!

657
00:30:35,667 --> 00:30:37,033
[KICKS LAND]

658
00:30:37,600 --> 00:30:38,767
[BLOWS LAND]

659
00:30:38,933 --> 00:30:41,533
[WATER SPLASHING]

660
00:30:47,967 --> 00:30:48,967
[KICK LANDS]

661
00:30:49,733 --> 00:30:51,067
[KICK LANDS]

662
00:30:53,567 --> 00:30:56,133
[RODS THUDDING]

663
00:30:56,267 --> 00:30:57,233
[BLOWS LAND]

664
00:30:57,400 --> 00:30:58,400
[BODY THUDS]

665
00:31:01,933 --> 00:31:03,367
- [KICK LANDS]
- [METAL CLANGING]

666
00:31:03,467 --> 00:31:05,033
[BLOWS LAND]

667
00:31:06,133 --> 00:31:07,400
[KICK LANDS, BLOWS LAND]

668
00:31:12,300 --> 00:31:13,267
[KICK LANDS]

669
00:31:14,000 --> 00:31:15,767
[BLOWS LAND]

670
00:31:19,267 --> 00:31:20,300
Come on!

671
00:31:20,467 --> 00:31:21,467
That's what I'm talking about!

672
00:31:21,633 --> 00:31:23,433
You can't take this land
from ours!

673
00:31:23,533 --> 00:31:24,933
- [LAUGHS EVILLY]
- Django, Django.

674
00:31:25,633 --> 00:31:26,833
Look, it's Gabo.

675
00:31:31,167 --> 00:31:32,600
[BLOWS LAND]

676
00:31:32,700 --> 00:31:33,633
[KICK LANDS]

677
00:31:35,333 --> 00:31:36,500
- [BODY THUDS]
- [LOUD THUD]

678
00:31:36,633 --> 00:31:37,467
[KICK LANDS]

679
00:31:37,633 --> 00:31:38,767
- [BODY THUDS]
- [LOUD THUD]

680
00:31:39,300 --> 00:31:40,933
Great timing!

681
00:31:41,033 --> 00:31:42,167
[LAUGHS EVILLY]

682
00:31:45,667 --> 00:31:46,633
Move!

683
00:31:51,733 --> 00:31:52,667
[GUNSHOT]

684
00:31:59,133 --> 00:32:01,667
- [BODY THUDS]
- Rudy!

685
00:32:03,467 --> 00:32:04,800
Rudy!

686
00:32:06,667 --> 00:32:07,633
Pa!

687
00:32:10,900 --> 00:32:11,867
Gabo!

688
00:32:12,567 --> 00:32:14,167
