689
00:32:14,700 --> 00:32:16,300
but now we're even!

690
00:32:16,433 --> 00:32:17,900
[LAUGHS EVILLY] Let's go!

691
00:32:20,700 --> 00:32:22,133
[BLOWS LAND]

692
00:32:22,233 --> 00:32:25,500
[BETCHAY WAILING] Rudy!

693
00:32:28,433 --> 00:32:29,500
Help!

694
00:32:31,100 --> 00:32:32,733
Help! Please help us!

695
00:32:32,867 --> 00:32:34,233
- Help!
- [BETCHAY WAILING] Rudy!

696
00:32:34,367 --> 00:32:35,567
- Uncle Rudy!
- Move!

697
00:32:35,700 --> 00:32:36,667
Uncle Rudy!

698
00:32:38,367 --> 00:32:39,533
Hurry! Hurry up!

699
00:32:40,067 --> 00:32:41,167
Let's take him to the hospital!

700
00:32:41,267 --> 00:32:42,967
Help! Please!

701
00:32:43,067 --> 00:32:46,867
[SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC CONTINUES]

702
00:32:47,033 --> 00:32:49,667
<i> Let us through! Move!</i>

703
00:32:51,033 --> 00:32:53,233
<i>I'll do everything
to save Papa.</i>

704
00:32:54,967 --> 00:32:56,933
<i> It's so hard to be poor.</i>

705
00:32:57,067 --> 00:33:00,267
<i>You feel helpless
in times like this.</i>

706
00:33:00,400 --> 00:33:02,667
<i> Where will Gabo get money?</i>

707
00:33:02,800 --> 00:33:05,500
<i>He'll resort to doing
the job he knows best.</i>

708
00:33:05,633 --> 00:33:08,033
<i>I know where we can earn
a lot of money.</i>

709
00:33:08,133 --> 00:33:10,033
<i>- A gay bar!
- What exactly is our job?</i>

710
00:33:10,133 --> 00:33:11,100
<i> Male stripper.</i>

711
00:33:12,267 --> 00:33:13,100
[CROWD GASP]

712
00:33:13,267 --> 00:33:15,167
"A perfect solution."

713
00:33:15,300 --> 00:33:16,867
<i>We've been keeping
you under surveillance.</i>

714
00:33:16,967 --> 00:33:18,033
<i> Gabo!</i>

715
00:33:18,133 --> 00:33:21,433
<i>You got released from prison
because of Anino.</i>

716
00:33:21,567 --> 00:33:22,433
<i> Tatang?</i>

717
00:33:22,600 --> 00:33:23,567
"Brace yourself."

718
00:33:27,833 --> 00:33:32,100
<i>Anino needs your help
in arresting criminals.</i>

719
00:33:32,233 --> 00:33:33,767
<i> Zafra, also known as Tiger.</i>

720
00:33:33,900 --> 00:33:35,767
<i>He runs an illegal gold
mining operation.</i>

721
00:33:35,900 --> 00:33:38,267
<i>We will find this person
tomorrow.</i>

722
00:33:38,400 --> 00:33:40,700
<i> We can't fail this mission.</i>

723
00:33:40,833 --> 00:33:42,600
<i> Tiger is no ordinary crook.</i>

724
00:33:42,733 --> 00:33:43,800
<i>How much will we
get from this?</i>

725
00:33:43,933 --> 00:33:44,933
<i> 100 million pesos.</i>

726
00:33:45,067 --> 00:33:46,133
"The quest to find money...

727
00:33:46,300 --> 00:33:48,067
<i>- Excuse me. Ow!
- Ow!</i>

728
00:33:48,167 --> 00:33:49,600
<i>- Ow!
- I'm sorry.</i>

729
00:33:49,733 --> 00:33:51,033
<i>- You?!
- You again?!</i>

730
00:33:51,167 --> 00:33:53,300
<i>- What do you mean by that?
- Are you stalking me?</i>

731
00:33:53,433 --> 00:33:54,633
<i> You're the one stalking me!</i>

732
00:33:54,767 --> 00:33:55,733
<i> You jerk!</i>

733
00:33:57,633 --> 00:33:58,733
<i>Do you want me
to kiss you?</i>

734
00:33:58,867 --> 00:34:00,667
...will lead to a fight."

735
00:34:00,800 --> 00:34:01,667
<i> NCIA! Freeze!</i>

736
00:34:01,833 --> 00:34:03,167
<i>Victor Zafra,
hands in the air!</i>

737
00:34:03,300 --> 00:34:04,833
- [GUNSHOTS]
- [SCREAMING]

738
00:34:04,967 --> 00:34:05,833
<i> Go after them!</i>

739
00:34:06,000 --> 00:34:07,933
<i>Let's split up!
Distract them!</i>

740
00:34:08,033 --> 00:34:08,900
[ENGINE REVVING]

741
00:34:09,033 --> 00:34:11,667
- [TIRES SCREECHING]
- [HORN HONKING]

742
00:34:13,200 --> 00:34:13,833
<i> Stop!</i>

743
00:34:14,000 --> 00:34:14,733
[GUNSHOTS]

744
00:34:14,867 --> 00:34:16,567
[BLOWS LANDING]

745
00:34:16,700 --> 00:34:17,900
- [THWACKING]
- [GROANS]

746
00:34:18,700 --> 00:34:19,733
- [THUD]
- [GLASS SHATTERS]

747
00:34:20,533 --> 00:34:23,467
<i>You ruined a lot of lives!
You should go to jail!</i>

748
00:34:23,600 --> 00:34:25,133
<i>You don't know who you're
going up against!</i>

749
00:34:25,267 --> 00:34:26,233
